<p>Aabid ko jaha'n Ghash aata hai, Durro'n se Jagaaya jaata hai,<br />
Ek phool hai jis ko Kaanto par Din-Raat Chalaaya jaata hai..</p>

<p>(1) Abbas ki Gairat se aksar Aabid ki Aseeri Puchhti hai,<br />
Kya chaar baras ki Behna ko Zinda'n mei'n Sulaaya jaata hai..</p>

<p>(2) Saadat ke Khaimey jaltey hai'n Sholo mei'n Ghiri hai Aal e Nabi,<br />
Phir aaj Nabi ki Beti par Darwaaza Giraaya jaata hai..</p>

<p>(3) Reh-Reh ke Shah e Dee'n deikhtey hai'n Naizey se Sakina(&#1587;) ki Jaanib,<br />
Lagta hai ke Pushte Naaqa se Bachhi ko Giraaya jaata hai..</p>

<p>(4) Bibi ko Qareeb e Laash e Jari Durro'n ki Aziyat detey hai'n,<br />
Abbas ko tadpaaney ke liye Zainab(&#1587;) ko Sataaya jaata hai..</p>

<p>(5) Gairat ke sabab jis Bibi ne Ghar mei'n bhi na dekha Aayina,<br />
Be-Parda usey laaney ke liye Darbar Sajaaya jaata hai..</p>

<p>(6) Bin byaah ke Akbar maarey gaye Armaan na nikley Baano ke,<br />
Taboot pe Akbar ke Sehra kuch yu'n bhi Chad'haaya jaata hai..</p>

<p>(7) Wo Nouke Sina'n par Gairat se Rukta hi nahi'n Gir jaata hai,<br />
Jab-Jab bhi Sar e Abbas e Jari Naizey pe Chad'haaya jaata hai..</p>

<p>(8) Pardey mei'n Bilal e Karbobala Roye na mera Moula kyu'n kar,<br />
Afsos ke Turbat mei'n ab tak Zahra ko Rulaaya jaata hai</p>